---
title:    "Overlapping Rules and Logic Variables in Functional Logic Programs"
citation: "(ICLP 2006)"
url:      "https://www.michaelhanus.de/papers/ICLP06.html"
date:     2006-01-01
---
This papers shows the equivalence of logic variables and
nondeterministic operations in functional logic programs
so that a kernel language need only to implement one of these features.
This result is the basis of the KiCS implementation of Curry.
